      {
       "_key": "000000000004",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Begin your Marsa Alam adventure by swimming with dolphins at the lesser-known but breathtaking Sataya Reef. Here, spinner dolphins play in waters less crowded than the famed "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000006",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000005"
       ],
       "text": "Dolphin"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000007",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " House, offering a more intimate experience. The reef itself is an underwater spectacle of pristine coral and crystal-clear waters, a short boat ride from "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000009",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000008"
       ],
       "text": "Hamata"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000000a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". For those who prefer shallow waters, Abu Dabab offers encounters with turtles, dolphins, and the elusive dugong, all accessible from the sandy beach – perfect for families and novice snorkelers."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000005",
       "_type": "externalLink",
       "href": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dolphin",
       "newTab": true
      },
