      {
       "_key": "000000000019",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Day Three – Exploring El Quseir"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001c",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001b",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Dedicate a day to shopping and sightseeing in the historic city of El Quseir. Visit the sixteenth-century Ottoman fort and stroll through the charming port. Shop in the local souks for authentic Egyptian goods at prices lower than hotel shops, but choose wisely as quality varies."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "normal"
    },
    {
     "_key": "00000000001e",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001d",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Day Four – Adventure on the High Seas or Sky"
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [],
     "style": "h3"
    },
    {
     "_key": "000000000023",
     "_type": "block",
     "children": [
      {
       "_key": "00000000001f",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Opt for deep-sea fishing in Marsa Alam’s rich waters, or if you’re seeking a thrill, try "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000021",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000020"
       ],
       "text": "kitesurfing at Mirage Resort"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000022",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": ". For a unique experience, head to Wadi Lahami’s legendary shallow lagoon for ideal kite surfing conditions, with soft, coral-free sand and a depth perfect for beginners."
      }
     ],
     "markDefs": [
      {
       "_key": "000000000020",
       "_pendingInternalRef": {
        "sourceLocale": "en",
