      {
       "_key": "000000000045",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": "Marsa Alam offers a diverse array of experiences, from underwater adventures and historical explorations to desert "
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000047",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000046"
       ],
       "text": "excursions"
      },
      {
       "_key": "000000000048",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [],
       "text": " and relaxing beach days. Each day presents an opportunity to immerse in the unique beauty and "
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004a",
       "_type": "span",
       "marks": [
        "000000000049"
       ],
       "text": "culture"
      },
      {
       "_key": "00000000004b",
